  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [rollup](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup) | devDependencies | minor | [`1.14.6` -> `1.15.5`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/rollup/1.14.6/1.15.5) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>rollup/rollup</summary>\n\n### [`v1.15.5`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1155)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.15.4...v1.15.5)\n\n_2019-06-14_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Do not include any comments for completely tree-shaken files so that `renderedLength === 0` is a reliable check ([#&#8203;2940](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2940))\n-   Do not cause type errors when returning `null` from `resolveId` ([#&#8203;2941](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2941))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2940](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2940): Completely omit files that do not have any included statements ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n-   [#&#8203;2941](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2941): Explicitly allow null as return value for various hooks ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.15.4`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1154)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.15.3...v1.15.4)\n\n_2019-06-14_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Improve how asset and chunk URLs are resolved for UMD, IIFE and CJS output ([#&#8203;2937](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2937))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2937](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2937): Fix URL resolution to work when the current script contains query parameters ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.15.3`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1153)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.15.2...v1.15.3)\n\n_2019-06-13_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Always reemit assets and chunks from cached transform hooks ([#&#8203;2936](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2936))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2936](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2936): Fix repeated re-emission of files emitted from a transform hook ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.15.2`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1152)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.15.1...v1.15.2)\n\n_2019-06-13_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Make sure chunks emitted from transform hooks are also emitted for incremental builds in watch mode ([#&#8203;2933](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2933))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2933](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2933): Reemit chunks emitted from transform hooks ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.15.1`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1151)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.15.0...v1.15.1)\n\n_2019-06-11_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Do not fail when reexporting variables in dynamic entry points from other chunks ([#&#8203;2928](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2928))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2928](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2928): Handle reexports from dynamic entries across chunk ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.15.0`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1150)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.14.6...v1.15.0)\n\n_2019-06-11_\n\n##### Features\n\n-   Tone down try-catch deoptimization while maintaining polyfill support ([#&#8203;2918](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2918))\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Handle feature detection with \"typeof\" for regular expressios ([#&#8203;2916](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2916))\n-   Deoptimize `'' + variable'` type coercion as expression statement for feature detection ([#&#8203;2917](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2917))\n-   Always observe argument side-effects when tree-shaking ([#&#8203;2924](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2924))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2916](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2916): Deoptimize typeof for regular expression literals to better support es6-shim ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n-   [#&#8203;2917](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2917): Support implicit type coercion errors in es5-shim ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n-   [#&#8203;2918](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2918): Deoptimize try-catch less radically ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n-   [#&#8203;2924](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2924): Do not tree-shake arguments with side-effects ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
